"""
Builds the Hungarian pages (hu/*.html) from the English ones.

Every English string on a page is listed here with its Hungarian text. The script
copies the English page, swaps each string, and stops with an error if a string
is no longer on the page, so an English edit can't silently leave the Hungarian
page out of date. Run it after changing an English page:

    python tools/build_hu.py

Radio calls stay in English on purpose: that is what you say on the radio and
what the stations answer.
"""

